WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:03.070
(Transcrit par TurboScribe. Passez à Illimité pour supprimer ce message.) My name is Wade Watts.

2
00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.150
My dad picked that name because it sounded

3
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:06.510
like a superhero's alter ego.

4
00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:09.270
Like Peter Parker or Bruce Banner.

5
00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:11.470
But he died when I was a kid.

6
00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:12.530
My mom too.

7
00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:15.710
And I ended up here.

8
00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:20.150
Sitting here in my tiny corner of nowhere.

9
00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:22.610
There's nowhere left to go.

10
00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:24.550
Nowhere.

11
00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:27.610
Except the Oasis.

12
00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:36.510
A whole virtual universe.

13
00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:45.070
People come to the Oasis for all the

14
00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:45.930
things they can do.

15
00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:52.310
But they stay because of all the things

16
00:00:52.310 --> 00:00:52.870
they can be.

17
00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:54.270
Can you feel this?

18
00:00:56.510 --> 00:00:57.350
Um, yeah.

19
00:00:57.350 --> 00:00:59.630
It's the only place that feels like I

20
00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:00.230
mean anything.

21
00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:04.450
The Oasis was the brainchild of James Halliday.

22
00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:04.930
Hello.

23
00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:07.310
If you're watching this, I'm dead.

24
00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:11.270
I created a hidden object, an Easter egg.

25
00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:14.330
The first person to find the egg will

26
00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:17.750
inherit half a trillion dollars and total control

27
00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:19.590
of the Oasis itself.

28
00:01:23.490 --> 00:01:25.370
Who is this Parzival?

29
00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:26.810
And how the hell is he winning?

30
00:01:27.910 --> 00:01:28.810
Find him.

31
00:01:29.210 --> 00:01:30.350
This isn't just a game.

32
00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:34.670
I'm talking about actual life and death stuff.

33
00:01:34.930 --> 00:01:37.430
The Oasis is the world's most important economic

34
00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:37.890
resource.

35
00:01:38.730 --> 00:01:40.870
And it's nothing less than a war for

36
00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:41.770
control of the future.

37
00:01:46.970 --> 00:01:48.770
Welcome to the rebellion, Wade.

38
00:01:57.850 --> 00:02:00.050
Like many of you, I only came here

39
00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:00.550
to escape.

40
00:02:01.730 --> 00:02:04.650
But I found something much bigger than just

41
00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:05.210
myself.

42
00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:07.370
Are you willing to fight?

43
00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:10.850
Help us save the Oasis.
